be <span class=\"strong\">commencer</span> \u00e0 la forme affirmative, n\u00e9gative et interrogative.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Le verbe COMMENCER \u00e0 la forme </br>affirmative, n\u00e9gative et interrogative</span> </div>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"je commence</br>\u2028tu commences</br>\u2028il/elle/on commence</br>\u2028nous commen<span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">\u00e7</span>ons</br>\u2028vous commencez</br>\u2028ils/elles commencent\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">je ne commence pas</br>\u2028tu ne commences pas</br>\u2028il/elle/on  ne commence pas</br>\u2028nous ne commen<span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">\u00e7</span>ons pas</br>\u2028vous ne commencez pas</br>\u2028ils/elles  ne commencent pas</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"commenc<span class=\\\"strong\\\">\u00e9</span>-je ?</br>\u2028commences-tu ?</br>\u2028commence-t-il/elle/on&nbsp;?</br>\u2028commen<span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">\u00e7</span>ons-nous ?</br>\u2028commencez-vous ?</br>\u2028commencent-ils/elles&nbsp;?</br>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"product-color-text\">Note : </span> Une c\u00e9dille <span class=\"strong\">\u00e7</span> appara\u00eet dans la conjugaison des verbes en <span class=\"strong\">\u2013cer</span> sous le <span class=\"strong\">c</span> devant les voyelles <span class=\"strong\">a</span> et <span class=\"strong\">o</span>. Ainsi l'on \u00e9crit : <span class=\"strong\">nous commen<span class=\"product-color-text\">\u00e7</span>ons</span> afin de conserver le son /s/.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Discutez avec votre camarade des 